e corona virus I got  purchasing orders from an Israeli  private company and another company in  Hebron in the West Bank a total of five  million masks  haboob has rehired more than a hundred  and fifty unemployed workers to fulfill  the massive orders but while he and his  employees are glad of this sudden surge  in demand there's also a fear that it  could be the prelude to a devastating  new crisis for Garza's economy and the  health of its people Harry Forsyth  al-jazeera
 

